---
/**
 * Quote.astro — scripture mirror section for /.
 *
 * The Hebrew mirror is decorative and pointer-inert. The full Russian quotation
 * sits beside it, so this leaf owner renders only the visible Hebrew face and
 * never enters the interactive sacred-word runtime. A tiny CSS-only group
 * response preserves a premium tactile feel without JS or layout movement.
 */
---
<section class="h-quote-section h-reveal" aria-label="Эпиграф">
  <div class="h-ornament" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>

  <div class="h-quote-mirror">
    <div class="h-quote-left">
      <blockquote class="h-blockquote h-blockquote--mirror">
        Господь Бог — сила моя: Он сделает ноги мои как у оленя и на высоты мои возведёт меня.
      </blockquote>
      <cite class="h-cite h-cite--mirror">— Аввакум 3:19</cite>
    </div>

    <div class="h-quote-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="h-quote-right">
      <div class="h-sacred-block h-sacred-block--mirror" aria-hidden="true" role="presentation">
        <span class="h-sacred-line h-sacred-line--1">
          <span class="h-sacred-mirror-word" lang="he">יְהוִה</span>
          <span class="h-sacred-mirror-word" lang="he">אֲדֹנָי</span>
          <span class="h-sacred-mirror-word" lang="he">חֵילִי</span>
        </span>

        <span class="h-sacred-line h-sacred-line--2">
          <span class="h-sacred-mirror-word" lang="he">וַיָּשֶׂם</span>
          <span class="h-sacred-mirror-word" lang="he">רַגְלַי</span>
          <span class="h-sacred-mirror-word" lang="he">כָּאַיָּלוֹת</span>
          <span class="h-sacred-mirror-word" lang="he">וְעַל</span>
          <span class="h-sacred-mirror-word" lang="he">בָּמוֹתַי</span>
          <span class="h-sacred-mirror-word" lang="he">יַדְרִכֵנִי</span>
        </span>

        <span class="h-sacred-ref h-sacred-ref--mirror">
          <span>Аввакум 3:19</span>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="h-ornament" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-top:28px;">✦</div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  body.home-page #main-content .h-sacred-block--mirror {
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* The former flip shell measured the Hebrew face with two extra pixels.
     Keep that optical width exactly, without retaining an interactive owner. */
  body.home-page #main-content .h-sacred-block--mirror .h-sacred-mirror-word {
    display: inline-block;
    box-sizing: content-box;
    margin: 0 .15em;
    padding-inline: 1px;
    vertical-align: baseline;
    color: var(--h-ink);
    font-family: var(--f-hebrew);
    font-weight: 500;
    opacity: .82;
    transform: scale3d(1, 1, 1);
    transform-origin: 50% 68%;
    transition:
      transform 460ms cubic-bezier(.2, .82, .24, 1),
      opacity 360ms ease;
  }

  /* Premium micro-response only: uniform elastic compression, no flip,
     translation, diagonal drift, script state or layout shift. */
  @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    body.home-page #main-content .h-quote-right:hover .h-sacred-mirror-word {
      opacity: .87;
      transform: scale3d(1.006, .994, 1);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    body.home-page #main-content .h-sacred-block--mirror .h-sacred-mirror-word {
      transition: none;
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
